tance-fighter/a-79668919?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">She started taking action against Hitler as a teenager and never stopped until her death in a concentration camp. Berlin's Blücherplatz is now being renamed after her.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>The dachshund, a humorous icon with political symbolism</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d7f920904619b304b3bfd571f0c22709205eeebc05a510c45ca80c84423933cd</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:34:36Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T07:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-dachshund-a-humorous-icon-with-political-symbolism/a-79640191--0ec0144d606e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-dachshund-a-humorous-icon-with-political-symbolism/a-79640191?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From Picasso to Andy Warhol, a surprising number of artists have portrayed the German breed. But the dachshund has also at times been co-opted as a political symbol.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>'Star Trek' star Patrick Stewart dies age 86</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:da70bf4c823ad0714688738d72b9648b32d2d8b20c30fd1be21d6a8c65005411</id><updated>2026-11-05T16:34:36Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T22:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/star-trek-star-patrick-stewart-dies-age-86/a-79803071--53b89389ae81.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/star-trek-star-patrick-stewart-dies-age-86/a-79803071?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Shakespearean actor landed the role of a lifetime as "Star Trek" Captain Picard. He passed away at age 86.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry></feed>
